    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoshwa kūhooya na batongeeji",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho lyabīta ikanza lya shikū ningī, nū SEEBA ūbiza wabifuugije a Baisilaeli ū kū banishi babo a bose abo baalī babapīndije hose hose, ū Yoshwa akongeja ū kūnamhaala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ikanza ilebe ū Yoshwa ūbitana pye a Baisilaeli, a banamhala babo, batogeeji ba ng'anda, balamuji, na a bagunanhi; ūbawīla gīkī, “Ū nene ī haha nanamhaalaga, jajaga ī shikū jaane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we benekīlī ng'wībonile pyī īyo SEEBA Mulungu wing'we wabīītīlile a banhū ba mahanga gose genayo kūlwa nguno ying'we. Ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we hū ng'wene ūyo walūmulwīlīīlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumanile ūmo nīīgabanhīgije pyī ī sī kū ng'anda jing'we ī jose, kūbiza wingīji wing'we; ī yose ī ya mahanga ayo twamalile kūgadima, na a yayo gaasaagile ho, kūfuma kīya kū mongo gwa Yolodani kūshisha kū ng'weli ū kū Nyanza ī Nhaale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we, wei ng'wenekīlī akūbasunda a banhū ba mahanga genayo bang'wīngīle; akūbapeeja bīnge ū kū būtongi wing'we, ng'wīdiime bing'we ī sī yabo, gīt'ūmo kūlī kwisagīja kwa ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a bing'we handatīlagi dūhū, ng'wīlondeele mu welwang'holò pyī īyo yandīkīlwe ū mu shitabo sha Shilagīlo sha ng'wa Musa; yaya kūgalūka kūja kū būlyo nūūlū kū lūmoso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kūbiza na būsangī nabo a banhū ba mahanga ayo gaasaagīīlile ū mu bing'we genaya, yaya ū kūgahaya a mina ga baamulungu babo, nūūlū kwilahīla mu mina gabo yaya. Yaya gete ū kūbatūmamīla, nūūlū kwinama kū būtongi wabo a baamulungu benabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo diimanagi na SEEBA Mulungu wing'we, gīt'ūmo mukwītīlaga kūshisha lelo īyī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA wamupeegegije mahanga mataale na ga nguzu ningī no; kūshisha haha īyī ataalī kwilonga nūūlū ūmò wa kūng'wīmīla a bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munhū ūmò ū mu bing'we akūpeejaga banhū shihūmbī shigima, nguno ū SEEBA hū ng'wene ūyo akūmulwīlīīlaga, gīt'ūmo walī wang'wisagīja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū ilang'hanagi dūhū a bing'we muntogwe gete ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū ng'ūgalūka, ng'wandya kūnwaana nabo a banhū ba mahanga ayo gaasaagīīlile ū mu bing'we, na ng'wandya kwitooleela nabo a banhū benabo na kūbiza na būsangī nabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a henaho deebagi hape gīkī ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we atūbapeeja bang'wīngīle a banhū ba mahanga genayo. A ha ng'wanya gwaaho bakūbiza lūtu lwa kūmugwasha a bing'we, na nang'ha gwa kūmudīīmūlīla kū ngongo, na magwaata ga kūmukwaala kū miso, kūshisha mukenaagūke mushile gete ū mu sī ī yawiza yenīyī, īyo wang'winhile ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nene ī haha nalī bbihī kūja ūko sī yose ījile; mumanile hape ū mu ng'holò jing'we nū mu būpanga wing'we bose, ī gīkī ū mu yose īyo SEEBA Mulungu wing'we wang'wisagīja, gūtīho nūūlū gūmò ūyo gūtashikīīlile. Būlī kwisagīja kwakwe kwashikīīlile, gūtalebile mhayo nūūlū gūmò yaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo gīt'ūmo yashikīīlile pyī īyo waalī wang'wisagīja ū SEEBA Mulungu wing'we, ū SEEBA akūng'wenhela gīko na a mabūbi a gose ayo wamuwīla, kūshisha amukenaagūle mushile ho gete ū mu sī ī yawiza yenīyī īyo wang'winhile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOS 23:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ng'ūlīkenaagūla ī lilagane lya ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu wing'we īlo wamulagīla kūlīdima, ng'wandya kūja kūbatūmamīla baamulungu bangī na kwinama kū būtongi wabo, a henaho ū būpelanu bo ng'wa SEEBA būkūng'widīkīla; mukūkenaagūka wangū no mushile ū mu sī ī yawiza īyo wang'winhile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.23.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.23.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
